    "detailed_description": "<i>Dawnbreaker - Aeon's Reach is an erotic visual novel that puts you in the heels of a jaded bounty hunter looking for fun, causing her to embark on a hot cosmic adventure with a bunch of outlaws.<br><br>Many different routes and girls await you in this lewd game, your choices changing the entire outcome of the story.<br><br>Will you be able to find what you desire in this universe?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><br>Dawnbreaker - Aeon's Reach is an erotic visual novel with many routes and choices supported by a cast of well-built characters.<br><br>It contains appealing, high-quality 3D graphics as well as animations to make this an unforgettable lewd experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631790/extras/54fd44b306174e1d334544353bc1cc55.avif?t=1636111639\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take part in an ambitious quest</h2></li></ul>Hop in on a lewd adventure with some of the hottest girls of the galaxy. What you do with them is up to you, so choose wisely.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631790/extras/8a24a0ba93a30493ab478ddda10bf3e4.avif?t=1636111639\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Danger is around every corner</h2></li></ul>Space is not a bed of roses. Anything could happen that could put an end to your adventure. Be careful about what you do and say.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1631790/extras/667c0fa7a8ba55450892e657c5e0d6d7.avif?t=1636111639\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A vibrant universe awaits</h2></li></ul>There are many locations for you to explore. Arid deserts, lush jungles, forgotten ships\u2026 All of them with their characteristics.